{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["#","^speaker:Wolf ","/#","#","^portrait:Wolf","/#","^“I knew I smelt something other than the <b>Lamb</b> but I didn't expect to see you again, Little Witch.\"","\n",{"->":"start"},["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":[["ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"next1"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"next1":[["^\"Tell me <b>Witch</b>. Where is the <b>Lamb<b>.\"","\n","#","^play_sound:WolfSnarl","/#","ev","str","^Help the wolf","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Refuse","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"next2"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"next3"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"next2":["^<i>[You point to the left to indicate where the Lamb rushed off]<i>","\n",{"->":"Truth"},{"#f":1}],"next3":["^<i>[You shake your head, expressing disagreement.]<i>","\n",{"->":"Disagree"},{"#f":1}],"Truth":["^\"Since you helped me, I will help you as well. Don't trust the <b>Narrator</b>. He is a <b>liar</b> himself and the one who keeps your <b>precious cat</b>.\"","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"Disagree":[["^\"Why because you believe the <b>Lying Lamb</b>? Don't trust it. It is another wolf in disguise who lies for fun.. So I'll ask again. Tell me where the <b>Lamb</b> went.\"","\n","#","^play_sound:Growl","/#","ev","str","^Help Wolf","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Help Lamb","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"next2"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"HelpLamb"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"HelpLamb":["^<i>You shake your head again.</i>","\n","^\"Fine.Have it your way Witch.\"","\n","#","^wolf_howl","/#","#","^wolf_vanish","/#","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}